ction class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">11.40.5409<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 25, 2017<br/>Summer Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170706140656&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Butterfly_Ring_7f6af0.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a butterfly ring <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:2, protection death +3%)</span>.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by players of level 50 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.20 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Very easily obtained ring with permanent 2 armor and 3% death protection.\nObtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>At the beginning of the test server to the Summer Update 2017, it had 10% death protection, and was meant to have 15 charges which would be drained when taking death damage only. These charges were however not visible in the description, which led to quite a bit of confusion as well as the reduction down to 3% death protection. In the end, the decision was made for the ring to be permanent with the weaker attributes.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Angry%20Sugar%20Fairy\">Angry Sugar Fairy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Carnisylvan\">Dark Carnisylvan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hawk%20Hopper\">Hawk Hopper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lavaworm\">Lavaworm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mercurial%20Menace\">Mercurial Menace</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nymph\">Nymph</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pixie\">Pixie</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Swan%20Maiden\">Swan Maiden</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Undertaker\">Undertaker</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Talila\">Talila</a></td><td>Fae Village</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/